 forget to add Unlimited to your wishlist and come share your ideas on Discord. Your contribution matters a lot!", "short_description": "Forget the track, skip the turns, and discover what 'speed' really means with Unlimited.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270720/header.jpg?t=1717412892", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1717412892", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2270720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1717412892", "website": "https://unlimitedvelocity.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video cards must be NVIDIA RTX-1000 series and higher, or AMD RX-6000 series and higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Video cards must be NVIDIA RTX-2000 series and higher, or AMD RX-6000 series and higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "